        "date": "2026-11-13T23:08:17Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge refreshed issue/931-wcs-index-post (#1101) into issue/931-wcs-index-app\n\nBrings upstream/main 2d15a617 in through the parent.\n\nConflicts: mcp/setup_tools.rs and ui/state.rs imports (main's new\nPostRef/api/inventory/stock_fit kept, WCS_SLOTS dropped as this slice\ndoes); operation/types/mod.rs (main's sinker/wire_edm exports kept,\nLEGACY_WCS_NAMES as this slice); post/tests/inverted_probe.rs and\nprobe_dialects.rs take main's recorded-input form (main moved them from\napp/tests; the recorded inputs already carry the index).\n\nSemantic follow-through for main's new code: setup_wcs_tilt.rs and\nmcp/wcs_tools.rs read the display name through setup::wcs_name instead\nof WCS_SLOTS; Dump literals in script_fanuc_lathe.rs, probe_no_coolant.rs\nand recorded_post_streams.rs take wcs: 1 (index) for \"G54\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
